# Ignore file for this Dockerfile, read by BuildKit as <dockerfile>.dockerignore. The context
# is the parent directory, which is not a git repository, so a plain .dockerignore there could
# not be committed. Patterns are still relative to that context root.
#
# Allowlisted: anything a COPY needs has to be named here.
*
!ibl-benchmark/
!app-brain-wide-bench/

# Local environments and build output inside those two trees. A host .venv copied over the
# image's own leaves a venv whose paths point at the build machine.
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.git/
